# Build context rules for apps/worker/Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# A root .dockerignore would also apply to the web app's Railpack build and hide apps/web.
# Only what the worker image copies is needed; keep secrets and bulk out of the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/.vite*
**/.tanstack
**/*.test.ts
.git
.env*
.claude
.private
.storage
docs
apps/web
captures
